<title>UK: Wickes names Bill Grimsey as new CEO.</title>
<headline>Wickes names Bill Grimsey as new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wickes Plc, the do-it-yourself retailer, said on Friday that it has appointed Bill Grimsey to the board as chief executive.  </p>
<p>Grimsey has been managing director of Wickes Building Supplies, the company's main subsidiary, since July 1996.</p>
<p>Former senior managers of Wickes are under investigation by the Serious Fraud Office, Britain's top fraud watchdog.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
